{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChLSS61NJEKC19EfG5E4M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I wrote the plan to `.ard/221/plan.md` and the role file to `.ard/221/triage-engineer.md` with status `done`. It is an Implementation plan only; nothing was built or run. I judged it size M, risk low to medium.\n\n- **Streak state:** the streak is stored under a new key in the scanner database's existing `meta` table. Old state files load unchanged, so no migration is needed.\n- **Posting:** a hook in `Pipeline.Run` posts through `Effects.CreateComment` on the status issue, so dry-run logs instead of posting. The comment holds the scanner name and a sanitised reason class (guard rule name, `scan_failed` or `max_open`), nothing from findings.\n- **Wiring and docs:** `internal/servecmd/scanners.go` passes in the status issue number, and `docs/proposal.md` gets a sentence describing the notice.\n- **Tests:** the plan names a table-driven test per outcome class, a restart mid-streak, a planted-marker redaction test, dry-run, and a missing status issue.\n- **Protected paths:** none are touched.\n\nOpen choices I made that a maintainer may want to change:\n- **Timeouts:** a timeout run counts as a `scan_failed` streak, since the issue doesn't name it.\n- **Neutral runs:** global-cap drops and `error` runs neither start nor end a streak.\n- **Class change:** if the reason class changes mid-streak, no second notice is posted."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3629,"cache_read_input_tokens":38021,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3629},"output_tokens":487,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"711e0cb1-1b6e-448a-8afe-a2ff0b4d4cdd